  "scales": {
    "$about": "Spacing on a 4px grid (4, 8, 16, 24, 32, 48, and 64 between sections); radius 6px for controls, 8px for surfaces. Text styles (type-*) are a weight, size/line-height and family for the font shorthand: display, headline-lg, headline-md, body-lg/md/sm, label-md and mono. The website uses only these; the app has its own denser sizes.",
